{"reference":["Preview by default. --confirm destroys managed resources (including Compose","volumes) and removes the lease only on success. Already absent is success.","A failed cleanup retains the lease for retry. down is an alias.","Examples:","  dibs release \u003cid\u003e","  dibs release \u003cid\u003e --confirm","Output: --axi for agents, --json for scripts (mutually exclusive).","Default: human on terminals; AXI for pipes or DIBS_AXI=1.","Lease commands: --full restores complete AXI records/text; JSON is always complete.","","Exit codes: 0 success (including no-ops), 1 operation failed, 2 invalid usage.","dibs job: child's exit code on completion; 124 deadline killed child;","75 (EX_TEMPFAIL) no slot within wait. Dibs's own 1/2 apply only when no child","was started. Signal termination returns 128 + signal number. Helper/wait","failures after start use 125/126 and diagnostics on stderr.","76 is SSH transport/protocol failure with unknown remote result (stderr).","Child exit 255 is preserved and is not confused with SSH failure."],"usage":"dibs release \u003cid\u003e [--confirm] [--json]"}
